      "content": "Please do not take the tramadol, as combining it with your Zoloft requires careful medical supervision because both prescription and off-label uses can carry significant interaction risks. Tramadol lowers the seizure threshold, which Zoloft can affect, potentially leading to dangerous neurological side effects. You should consult your doctor or pharmacist immediately to discuss safer pain relief options for your injury before taking any medication.",
