      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the warning. i'm just really worried about the doctor's office being closed for the weekend and i don't want to pay for an urgent care visit if i don't have to. is there something else i can take? like can i just take a higher dose of ibuprofen or maybe some benadryl to help me sleep through the pain since i'm feeling pretty restless? i just need something to take the edge off right now.",
